            <ArticleTitle>[The treatment of chronic pain symptoms with psychotropic drugs (author's transl)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>337-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The results of longlasting experience in the treatment of severe chronic pain are reported. 82% of 103 in-patients with chronic pain responded to a combined treatment with neuroleptic and antidepressant drugs. A dosing strategy for the combbination of clomipramine and haloperidol is described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
